                <mxCell id="5" value="&lt;b&gt;User/Policy&lt;/b&gt;: Add VLAN 100 named Engineering&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;ConfigIntent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;intent_type: IntentType.CREATE_VLAN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;parameters: {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;  &#39;vlan_id&#39;: 100,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;  &#39;name&#39;: &#39;Engineering&#39;,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;  &#39;description&#39;: &#39;Engineering department&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
